        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Division 4-Enforcement ",
            "block_bbox": [
                164,
                183,
                529,
                208
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "84 In-house asset rules must be complied with.",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                248,
                738,
                272
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Each trustee of a regulated superannuation fund must take all reasonable steps to ensure that the provisions of Division 2, and either Division 3 or 3A (whichever is applicable), are complied.with.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                294,
                979,
                403
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Note:Section 166 imposes an administrative penalty for a contravention of.subsection (1) in relation to a self managed superannuation fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                292,
                418,
                1010,
                465
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision as defined by.\nsection 193, and Part 21 therefore provides for civil and criminal.\nconsequences of contravening, or of being involved in a.\ncontravention of, that subsection.\n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                247,
                489,
                1003,
                600
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) A contravention of subsection (1) does not affect the validity of a.transaction.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                245,
                622,
                1013,
                678
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
